e the PSP to continue to provide and enhance this service. SCC will be able to buy back data services from the PSP during the contract term and there will be opportunities for the PSP to offer the provision of private networks to industry, 3rd parties and SCC.</P><P>Continues in II.2.4 below.</P></SHORT_DESCR><VAL_ESTIMATED_TOTAL CURRENCY="GBP">80000000.00</VAL_ESTIMATED_TOTAL><VAL_TOTAL CURRENCY="EUR">80000000.00</VAL_TOTAL><NO_LOT_DIVISION/><OBJECT_DESCR ITEM="1"><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="64200000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="72000000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="32400000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="32500000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="48200000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="48500000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="48800000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="48960000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="72318000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="72400000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="72710000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="72720000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="79342000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="79342300"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="79400000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="79411100"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="79413000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="79416200"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="79418000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="79420000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="79421000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="80000000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_ADDITIONAL><CPV_CODE CODE="80300000"/></CPV_ADDITIONAL><n2021:NUTS CODE="UKC23"/><MAIN_SITE><P>SCC boundaries and potential neighbouring areas.</P></MAIN_SITE><SHORT_DESCR><P>The objective of the JV is to establish a 5G Neutral Host across the administrative area of SCC. The initial deployment will be for the City Centre / Riverside Sunderland development. The JV will deliver 5G and strategic network infrastructure to accelerate the regeneration of Riverside Sunderland and City Centre. </P></SHORT_DESCR><AC><AC_CRITERION>Quality 80%</AC_CRITERION><AC_CRITERION>Price 20%</AC_CRITERION></AC><DURATION TYPE="MONTH">240</DURATION><NO_EU_PROGR_RELATED/><INFO_ADD><P>The estimated value of the concession is between £70m to £80m over the 20-year term. However, potential returns will depend on many commercial factors including (but not limited to) market conditions. </P></INFO_ADD></OBJECT_DESCR></OBJECT_CONTRACT><PROCEDURE><PT_AWARD_CONTRACT_WITH_PRIOR_PUBLICATION/><MAIN_FEATURES_AWARD><P>Multi-stage competitive dialogue procedure.</P></MAIN_FEATURES_AWARD><NOTICE_NUMBER_OJ>2020/S 227-560777</NOTICE_NUMBER_OJ></PROCEDURE><AWARD_CONTRACT ITEM="1"><TITLE><P>Strategic Partner for the Sunderland Smart City 5G Neutral Host</P></TITLE><AWARDED_CONTRACT><DATE_CONCLUSION_CONTRACT>2021-09-28</DATE_CONCLUSION_CONTRACT><TENDERS><NB_TENDERS_RECEIVED>01</NB_TENDERS_RECEIVED></TENDERS><CONTRACTORS><NO_AWARDED_TO_GROUP/><CONTRACTOR><ADDRESS_CONTRACTOR><OFFICIALNAME>BAI Communications Europe Ltd &amp; BAI Communications Infrastructure Ltd</OFFICIALNAME><ADDRESS>Level 2, 2 Kingdom Street</ADDRESS><TOWN>London</TOWN><POSTAL_CODE>W2 6BD</POSTAL_CODE><COUNTRY VALUE="UK"/><n2021:NUTS CODE="UKI"/><URL>www.baicommunications.com</URL></ADDRESS_CONTRACTOR><NO_SME/></CONTRACTOR></CONTRACTORS><VALUES><VAL_ESTIMATED_TOTAL CURRENCY="GBP">80000000.00</VAL_ESTIMATED_TOTAL><VAL_TOTAL CURRENCY="GBP">80000000000.00</VAL_TOTAL></VALUES></AWARDED_CONTRACT></AWARD_CONTRACT><COMPLEMENTARY_INFO><ADDRESS_REVIEW_BODY><OFFICIALNAME>High Courts of Justice</OFFICIALNAME><ADDRESS>The Royal Court of Justice, The Strand</ADDRESS><TOWN>London</TOWN><POSTAL_CODE>WC2A 2LL</POSTAL_CODE><COUNTRY VALUE="UK"/></ADDRESS_REVIEW_BO